  "description": "Compares two Dynamics 365 / Dataverse environments (for example DEV and UAT) and lists the configuration differences between them, ranked ERROR, WARN and INFO. Compares solutions, environment variables, connection references, plugin steps, web resources, business rules, workflows, actions, process flows and cloud flows. Scope by publisher, solution and area. Read-only: it only queries Dataverse.",
